{
  "sn22.49:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 22.49 ",
  "sn22.49:0.2": "5. Attadīpavagga ",
  "sn22.49:0.3": "Soṇasutta ",
  "sn22.49:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "sn22.49:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā rājagahe viharati veḷuvane kalandakanivāpe. ",
  "sn22.49:1.3": "Atha kho soṇo gahapatiputto yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami …pe… ",
  "sn22.49:1.4": "ekamantaṁ nisinnaṁ kho soṇaṁ gahapatiputtaṁ bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "sn22.49:2.1": "“Ye hi keci, soṇa, samaṇā vā brāhmaṇā vā aniccena rūpena dukkhena vipariṇāmadhammena ‘seyyohamasmī’ti vā samanupassanti; ",
  "sn22.49:2.2": "‘sadisohamasmī’ti vā samanupassanti; ",
  "sn22.49:2.3": "‘hīnohamasmī’ti vā samanupassanti; ",
  "sn22.49:2.4": "kimaññatra yathābhūtassa adassanā? ",
  "sn22.49:2.5": "Aniccāya vedanāya dukkhāya vipariṇāmadhammāya ‘seyyohamasmī’ti vā samanupassanti; ",
  "sn22.49:2.6": "‘sadisohamasmī’ti vā samanupassanti; ",
  "sn22.49:2.7": "‘hīnohamasmī’ti vā samanupassanti; ",
  "sn22.49:2.8": "kimaññatra yathābhūtassa adassanā? ",
  "sn22.49:2.9": "Aniccāya saññāya … ",
  "sn22.49:2.10": "aniccehi saṅkhārehi dukkhehi vipariṇāmadhammehi ‘seyyohamasmī’ti vā samanupassanti; ",
  "sn22.49:2.11": "‘sadisohamasmī’ti vā samanupassanti; ",
  "sn22.49:2.12": "‘hīnohamasmī’ti vā samanupassanti; ",
  "sn22.49:2.13": "kimaññatra yathābhūtassa adassanā? ",
  "sn22.49:2.14": "Aniccena viññāṇena dukkhena vipariṇāmadhammena ‘seyyoh